OL,3,GNEWSATap water rationing a 'last
OL,4,Aresort' in severe drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FTap water rationing is among measures
OL,7,FSouth West Water could take in the case
OL,8,Fof severe drought but "will not be
OL,9,Fneeded" this winter, the firm has said.
OL,11,FThe "contingency plan" was described by
OL,12,Fthe utility as a "last resort" in case
OL,13,Fof the most severe category of drought,
OL,14,Fwhich the utility said it was not
OL,15,Ffacing.
OL,17,FJulian Brazil, Liberal Democrat leader
OL,18,Fof Devon County Council, said he feared
OL,19,Frationing could be a prospect in
OL,20,Ffuture, saying it could have a "massive
OL,21,Fknock-on effect" for businesses,
OL,22,Fschools and emergency services.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
