OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSATap water rationing a 'last
OL,4,Aresort' in severe drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Environment, Food
OL,7,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) said there
OL,8,Fwere "no plans" for rationing and it
OL,9,Fdid not anticipate "any impact on
OL,10,Fpublic water supplies".
